    "description": "<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">Elevate your streetwear look with these <strong>Light Blue Wide-Leg Baggy Jeans</strong>. Designed with a relaxed silhouette and washed denim finish, they offer a comfortable fit with a modern urban aesthetic. The classic five-pocket design and versatile light blue shade make them easy to style with oversized tees, shirts, hoodies, and sneakers.<span class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>",
