    "description": "<p>Make a bold statement with this <strong>red graphic printed hoodie</strong>, designed for a relaxed oversized streetwear look. Featuring a striking front graphic, long sleeves, an adjustable hood, and a spacious kangaroo pocket, it delivers both style and everyday comfort. Perfect for casual outfits, winter layering, and modern urban fashion.</p>",
