    "badge": "Graphic",
    "description": "<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">The Straight Up Graphic Full-Sleeve Raglan Sweatshirt is a great way to express yourself. Its white body, blue raglan sleeves, and its \u201cStraight Up!\u201d graphic in the front gives you an updated retro-street style look. The design makes it suitable for wearing in cooler weather or even when layering.</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>",
