    "badge": "Oversized",
    "description": "<p>Upgrade your regular wear with the The Nostalgia Simulator Oversized Graphic Ringer T-Shirt. The t-shirt features a cool retro graphic design on a high-quality grey melange fabric. The t-shirt is an oversized t-shirt that is stylishly designed with ringer design elements and a contemporary urban look. The t-shirt is contrasted with a black ribbed neck and sleeve edges. Wear it with cargo shorts, jeans, and joggers.</p>",
