    "vendor": "Thread77",
    "badge": "Oversized",
    "description": "<p>Go bold in the Faint Souls Vintage Angel Graphic Oversized Sweatshirt. Designed to incorporate a striking gothic design including angels' drawings, ornamental elements, and beautiful script lettering, the sweatshirt combines vintage design with streetwear elements. Made of high-quality cotton blend material, the sweatshirt comes with an oversized silhouette that guarantees you will feel comfortable in it all day long. It goes perfectly well with cargo pants, denim, and joggers.</p>",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p>Go bold in the Faint Souls Vintage Angel Graphic Oversized Sweatshirt. Designed to incorporate a striking gothic design including angels' drawings, ornamental elements, and beautiful script lettering, the sweatshirt combines vintage design with streetwear elements. Made of high-quality cotton blend material, the sweatshirt comes with an oversized silhouette that guarantees you will feel comfortable in it all day long. It goes perfectly well with cargo pants, denim, and joggers.</p>",
