    "vendor": "Thread77",
    "badge": "Oversized",
    "description": "<p>Elevate your basic clothing with the Mocha Ribbed Stripe Oversized T-Shirt, ideal for creating an effortlessly stylish look and being comfortable in the process. The T-shirt is made from high-quality ribbed knit fabric and incorporates classic shades of brown and beige stripes in a horizontal pattern.</p>",
