    "badge": "Oversized",
    "description": "<p>Elevate your everyday wardrobe with this <strong data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"244\">Men's White Waffle Knit Oversized Henley Full Sleeve T-Shirt</strong>. Crafted from premium waffle-textured fabric this full sleeve Henley combines modern minimalism with superior comfort. The relaxed oversized fit and classic three-button Henley neckline make it an ideal choice for casual wear, streetwear styling, and layering throughout the year. Pair it effortlessly with jeans, cargos, or trousers for a clean and timeless look.</p>",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p>Elevate your everyday wardrobe with this <strong data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"244\">Men's White Waffle Knit Oversized Henley Full Sleeve T-Shirt</strong>. Crafted from premium waffle-textured fabric this full sleeve Henley combines modern minimalism with superior comfort. The relaxed oversized fit and classic three-button Henley neckline make it an ideal choice for casual wear, streetwear styling, and layering throughout the year. Pair it effortlessly with jeans, cargos, or trousers for a clean and timeless look.</p>",
