    "badge": "Oversized",
    "description": "<p>Keep your style clean and effortless with this <strong data-start=\"172\" data-end=\"224\">Men's Beige Oversized Henley Full Sleeve T-Shirt</strong>. Designed with a modern oversized fit and a classic two-button Henley neckline, this premium tee offers all-day comfort with a minimalist aesthetic. The soft, breathable fabric makes it perfect for daily wear, casual outings, travel, and layering across seasons. Pair it with cargos, jeans, or joggers for a versatile streetwear-inspired look.</p>",
