    "descriptionHtml": "<p>Enhance your casual wardrobe by getting yourself these Men\u2019s Premium Wide Leg Denim Pants that are specially made for a comfy feel and ultimate streetwear fashion. Made up of high-quality denim fabric, these baggy jeans come with an elegant dark blue wash with faded details and can be easily paired with any casual wear such as T-shirts, hoodies, and sneakers.</p>",
