    "vendor": "Thread77",
    "badge": "Oversized",
    "description": "<p>Step into contemporary streetwear with the <strong data-start=\"502\" data-end=\"544\">SSGT Sensory Session Oversized T-Shirt</strong>, designed for those who appreciate minimalist fashion with a bold edge. Made from premium heavyweight cotton, this oversized tee features a clean SSGT Sensory Session graphic print on the front, contrast stitching, and a relaxed silhouette for maximum comfort. The versatile taupe color makes it easy to pair with cargos, denim, or joggers, making it a wardrobe essential for everyday wear, travel, and casual outings.</p>",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p>Step into contemporary streetwear with the <strong data-start=\"502\" data-end=\"544\">SSGT Sensory Session Oversized T-Shirt</strong>, designed for those who appreciate minimalist fashion with a bold edge. Made from premium heavyweight cotton, this oversized tee features a clean SSGT Sensory Session graphic print on the front, contrast stitching, and a relaxed silhouette for maximum comfort. The versatile taupe color makes it easy to pair with cargos, denim, or joggers, making it a wardrobe essential for everyday wear, travel, and casual outings.</p>",
