    "vendor": "Thread77",
    "badge": "Oversized",
    "description": "<p>Discover the perfect fusion of urban fashion and utility-inspired design<strong> </strong>with the Bufords<strong data-start=\"537\" data-end=\"574\"> </strong>Utility Oversized T-Shirt. Crafted from premium cotton, this oversized tee features a clean front, bold back statement print, functional utility detailing, and a relaxed silhouette for effortless style. Designed for comfort and versatility, it's the ideal choice for everyday wear, travel, and modern streetwear outfits. Pair it with cargo pants, denim, or joggers for a bold contemporary look.</p>",
