    "description": "<p>Elevate your streetwear collection with the <strong data-start=\"478\" data-end=\"528\">Red Gothic Cross Oversized Full Sleeve T-Shirt</strong>. Crafted from premium cotton, this statement piece features a bold white gothic cross graphic on the front, striking sleeve typography, and an inspirational quote that adds a unique edge. The oversized silhouette and soft breathable fabric provide superior comfort, making it ideal for everyday wear, casual outings, concerts, travel, and urban fashion styling. Pair it with cargos, denim, or sneakers for a standout streetwear look.</p>",
