    "vendor": "Thread77",
    "badge": "Oversized",
    "description": "<p>Refresh your casual wardrobe with the <strong data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"530\">Premium Ribbed Henley Oversized T-Shirt</strong>, designed for comfort and effortless style. Crafted from premium cotton-blend ribbed fabric, this oversized tee features a classic 3-button Henley neckline, soft textured finish, and a relaxed fit for a contemporary streetwear look. Perfect for daily wear, travel, weekends, and casual outings, it pairs easily with jeans, cargos, or shorts for a clean and versatile outfit.</p>",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p>Refresh your casual wardrobe with the <strong data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"530\">Premium Ribbed Henley Oversized T-Shirt</strong>, designed for comfort and effortless style. Crafted from premium cotton-blend ribbed fabric, this oversized tee features a classic 3-button Henley neckline, soft textured finish, and a relaxed fit for a contemporary streetwear look. Perfect for daily wear, travel, weekends, and casual outings, it pairs easily with jeans, cargos, or shorts for a clean and versatile outfit.</p>",
