    "description": "<p>Make a statement with the <strong data-start=\"144\" data-end=\"185\">Heliora Oversized Long Sleeve T-Shirt</strong>, designed for modern streetwear enthusiasts. Crafted from premium heavyweight cotton, this navy blue tee features a bold gothic-inspired chest graphic and a relaxed oversized fit for superior comfort and effortless style. Finished with a unique zipper detail on the sleeve, it adds an edgy touch that stands out. Perfect for casual wear, layering, or everyday street fashion.</p>",
