    "badge": "New in",
    "description": "<p>Add timeless style to your wardrobe with the Soft Cotton Button-Down Check Shirt<strong data-start=\"181\" data-end=\"229\">\u00a0</strong>\u00a0Crafted from soft, breathable cotton, this long-sleeve button-down shirt features a classic burgundy and white plaid pattern with a comfortable regular fit. Perfect for casual outings, work, weekend wear, or layering during cooler seasons, it combines everyday comfort with a modern, versatile look.</p>",
